heir child's Trump Account&#8212;many accounts with money already in them. =
We are also communicating with parents of newborns about the one-time $1,00=
0 contribution from the U.S. Treasury, available to children born between J=
an. 1, 2025, and Dec. 31, 2028.</p>
<p align=3D"left" style=3D"margin: 0px 0px 15px; text-align: left; color: r=
